---
version: "1.0.0"
owner: "tech-lead:{{ owner_full_name }}"
last_reviewed: "YYYY-MM-DD"
ramp_window_days: 10
review_cadence: "quarterly"
rung_label_prefix: "ramp/rung-"
---

# Ramp Task Difficulty Ladder — {{ team_name }}

## Ladder (at least 4 rungs; scope, not points)

| Rung | Name | Ticket pattern (files max / modules max / flag / design review; examples) | Expected duration (min-max days) | Buddy support | Evidence (merged PR, newcomer, actual days) | Tagged tickets (>= 2, label, critical path, deadline in window) |
|------|------|------|------|------|------|------|
| 1 | read-only change that ships | 1 / 1 / no / no; docs typo fix, dependency bump, log line | 0.25-1 | full_pairing | <PR url>, <newcomer>, <days> | <ticket> ramp/rung-1 no no; <ticket> ramp/rung-1 no no |
| 2 | single-file change | 1 / 1 / no / no; rename a function and its call sites | 1-2 | pair_on_pr | <PR url>, <newcomer>, <days> | <ticket> ramp/rung-2 no no; <ticket> ramp/rung-2 no no |
| 3 | single-module change behind a flag | 5 / 1 / yes / no; new endpoint behind a flag | 2-3 | review_on_pr | <PR url>, <newcomer>, <days> | <ticket> ramp/rung-3 ...; <ticket> ramp/rung-3 ... |
| 4 | cross-module change with design review | 12 / 2 / yes / yes; small refactor across 2 modules | 3-5 | review_on_design | <PR url>, <newcomer>, <days> | <ticket> ramp/rung-4 ...; <ticket> ramp/rung-4 ... |
| 5 | end-to-end feature slice | 25 / 3 / yes / yes; small feature API to storage | 5-10 | scheduled_check_ins | not_applicable: unvalidated | <ticket> ramp/rung-5 ...; <ticket> ramp/rung-5 ... |

## Ramps (one block per newcomer)

- newcomer: <handle>; start_date: YYYY-MM-DD; tickets_tagged_on: YYYY-MM-DD (before the start date)
- progression: rung 1 <ticket> merged YYYY-MM-DD <days>; rung 2 ...; (a ticket past 2x its band: reclassified_to_rung N)
- time_to_first_pr_days: <n>; rung_reached_on_last_day: <n>

## Outcome review

- Last run: {{ iso_date }}
- Next due: {{ next_review_date }} (within the review cadence)
- Ramps reviewed: <n>; median time to first PR: <days> (tolerance: 3 working days)
- Per rung: rung, median actual days, within band, consecutive out-of-band cycles, action (none | rebanded | pattern_rewritten)
- Version bumped: yes | no (yes whenever any rung was rebanded or rewritten)

